{"id": 1006480, "slug": "return-to-ash", "name": "Return to Ash", "name_original": "Return to Ash", "description": "<p><strong>What would you do if you woke up in the afterlife?</strong><br/><br/>The hospital room she knew is gone. Beyond the window lies a blank, white void that stretches endlessly. Instead of the usual aches and pains, she awakens feeling better than she has in years. Is this a dream, or…?<br/><br/><strong>Return to Ash</strong> is a narrative-driven visual novel focused on emotional storytelling and relationship building. Your decisions will shape Ashleigh’s journey, and determine how her story ends.<br/><br/>Explore a mysterious afterlife, forge bonds with others trapped in this strange purgatory, and face impossible, torturous trials from a masked being who calls themself “Death”.<br/></p><strong>Features:</strong><ul><li><p><strong>Narrative-Driven Visual Novel:</strong> Immerse yourself in an emotional story about life, death, and everything in between.</p></li><li><p><strong>Choices That Matter:</strong> Build relationships with a cast of memorable characters, each with their own dreams, regrets, and reasons to return to life.</p></li><li><p><strong>Unique Art Style:</strong> A distinct and atmospheric visual design brings the afterlife and its mysteries to life.</p></li><li><p><strong>Original Soundtrack:</strong> Experience a beautiful, emotional score that complements every twist and turn of Ashleigh’s journey.</p></li><li><p><strong>Short and Impactful:</strong> A complete story experience with multiple endings, designed to be finished in 2-4 hours.</p></li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-07-10", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-04-05T13:14:35", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/7a3/7a372f3123c691aba547dbd553eaaef0.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/d03/d03e4153254dcb643eb7e2f6d833ab30.jpg", "website": "https://serenityforge.com/"