self “Death”.\nFeatures:Narrative-Driven Visual Novel: Immerse yourself in an emotional story about life, death, and everything in between.Choices That Matter: Build relationships with a cast of memorable characters, each with their own dreams, regrets, and reasons to return to life.Unique Art Style: A distinct and atmospheric visual design brings the afterlife and its mysteries to life.Original Soundtrack: Experience a beautiful, emotional score that complements every twist and turn of Ashleigh’s journey.Short and Impactful: A complete story experience with multiple endings, designed to be finished in 2-4 hours."}